\par\par \b \uc2 Mexico eyeing  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  liquidity as peso slumps -official\b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Juni 2012\par 21:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MONTERREY, Mexico, June 6 (Reuters) - Mexico is closely watching for any deterioration in liquidity conditions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market that could justify more forceful official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Deputy Finance Minister Gerardo Rodriguez said on Wednesday.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso slumped to a three-year low last week, raising speculation the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  commission, made up of officials from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Finance Ministry, could step up \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  efforts to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  commission ... is very closely watching the interaction of traders and market dynamics in case it were necessary to activate another type of mechanism, with the goal of preserving the integrity of the market," Rodriguez said.\par \par \uc2 "There has never been a lack of liquidity, depth and prices in the markets," he said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  has eschewed the ad hoc market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen in Brazil, India and Indonesia and instead relies on a program in which a large dip automatically triggers an auction of $400 million.\par \par \uc2 Only two auctions have been triggered since the program was revived late last year.\par \par \uc2 Last Friday, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Agustin Carstens said Mexico was committed to its flexible exchange rate, but he said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was prepared to deal with peso volatility, invoking authorities' discretion to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Gabriela Lopez; Editing by Leslie Adler)\par \par \uc2 MEXICO-ECONOMY/PESO | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | NAT | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120606e8660015a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
