\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil's dollar purchases end real rally\b0\par\par\uc2 529 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Februar 2012\par 17:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Brazil's real reverses gains after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys forwards first time this year\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Chile pesos gain amid better global views\par \par \uc2 By Silvio Cascione and Jos\u233\'00\'E9 de Castro\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Feb 3 (Reuters) - The Brazilian real weakened for the first day in four on Friday, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time this year to stem a rally that risks slowing an economic recovery.\par \par \uc2 The real fell 0.3 percent to 1.725 to the dollar in early afternoon trading after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called an auction to buy U.S. dollar forwards. That reversed earlier gains of as much as 0.3 percent. By buying forwards, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  soaks up excess dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by capping future supply of the greenback.\par \par \uc2 "What's important here is that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which signals that it won't permit the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise too much," said Glauber Romano, a trader with Intercam Corretora de Cambio in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 The bank's first attempt to arrest the real's 8.3 percent jump this year indicates worries among government policymakers over the size and impact of the rally on exports and economic growth. A stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually makes Brazilian-made goods less competitive in global markets, hampering export revenue.\par \par \uc2 The last time Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was on Dec. 15, when it tried to sell dollars on the spot market after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened sharply on fears the global economy was slipping back into recession.\par \par \uc2 Some of the gains in the real stem from massive capital inflows from investors seeking high-yielding, riskier assets such as Latin American stocks, bonds and \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . A record $7.1 billion flowed into the Brazilian stock market last month, according to data by BM&FBovespa, the exchange operator.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian President Dilma Rousseff is seeking to help local carmakers by hiking taxes on some foreign-made cars last year. She is also said to have ordered the end of a long-standing deal with Mexico for tariff-free bilateral trade in automobiles and parts.\par \par \uc2 Other major Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept strengthening on Friday after a surge in job creation in the United States added to market optimism that the global economy is improving.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso was trading at a fresh 4-1/2 month high, boosted by rising prices for top export copper and better-than-expected U.S. jobs data. The peso was 0.35 percent stronger to bid at 478.20 pesos to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Better job data in the United States also strengthened the Mexican peso, which was trading 0.65 percent firmer.\par \par \uc2 "As world volatility comes down investors are getting more constructive and you see a resumption of carry trade and a search for higher yields," said Igor Arsenin, an emerging market strategist with \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 . "Authorities in Brazil are very sensitive to the level of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . We are likely to see more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Alonso Soto and Guillermo Parra-Bernal; Editing by Andrew Hay)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120206e8230018o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
